        "positioning": {
          "en": "This strategy had previously been little more than a casual concept, but The Sackville-Bagginses from HOB may be its final missing piece. As a sacrifice outlet, Treasure accelerator, and sacrifice-based damage engine, it fits the rest of the deck exceptionally well.",
          "zh": "这个思路以前基本属于娱乐级，而HOB的萨克维尔巴金斯家族可能一定程度上是这个思路的最后一块拼图。作为单次牺牲源+珍宝加速+牺牲打血引擎，整体和现有结构都非常搭。"
